Allow up to 32 CRT VOLECommit masks

The CRT VOLECommit stores, for each column of the lifted VOLE matrix, a hash with one bit per mask
in a uint16_t, so it supports at most 16 masks (QuickSilver degree 13). vole-mole's issuance proof
uses degree 16, which needs 15 + 4 = 19 masks.

TODO(cjpatton) Propose this change to faest-arch-opt authors. First, check with the FAEST authors
that nothing in the CRT VOLECommit analysis depends on at most 16 masks.

